# One field: "a", "a+b" and the message that carries it.
click #a
# Another: "a+b", and "scaled", whose local function reads it.
click #b
# "scaled" again, through its argument.
click #c
# A field read inside a function of this module.
click #x
# A field nothing but another module's function reads.
click #y
click #pick
# The card is called again.
click #rename
# The list's new row.
click #push
click #set
# The model as it was: only what may have an effect.
click #noop
